      "source": "Initially created with a map of file extensions and media types.\nSubsequently, subclasses can use <a href=\"#addMapping(java.lang.String,org.springframework.http.MediaType)\"><code>addMapping(String, MediaType)</code></a> to add more mappings.",
      "translation": "最初使用文件扩展名和媒体类型的映射创建。随后，子类可以使用<a href=\"#addMapping(java.lang.String,org.springframework.http.MediaType)\"><code>addMapping(String, MediaType)</code></a>添加更多映射。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create an instance with the given map of file extensions and media types.",
